{"event": "turn", "session_id": "8cae132ff87d4760967d39fc0b0a3dcd", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:28:49.620807+00:00", "message": "介绍白茶", "resolved_question": "介绍白茶", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 23.639, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5593, "output_tokens": 697, "response": {"answer": "**白茶简介**\n\n根据 ISO 20715:2023《茶 — 茶类分类》，白茶是指采摘的茶芽经**萎凋和干燥**两个阶段加工而成的茶。这里的“白茶”指的是山茶属（Camellia sinensis）茶树的茶类型及加工方式，而不是用白色花朵或草本植物泡制的饮品。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n\n**几点补充说明：**\n\n- **茶类与品种不同**：白茶是加工产品类型，与茶树品种（cultivar）是两个概念。同一品种用不同加工方法可制成不同茶类，因此品种本身不决定成品茶类型或香气，加工方式同样关键。（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）\n- **产品描述可多维度**：一款茶产品可从加工类型、品种、产地、制作风格、等级、添加配料、产品形态等多方面描述，不宜只用一个茶类标签概括。（来源：Typology of Processed Tea）\n\n**关于风味、用途、价格、库存等**：本次工具未提供白茶风味、功效用途、价格或库存数据，这些属性无法验证，暂不能为您介绍。\n\n如果您想了解具体某款白茶商品的价格或库存，可以告诉我商品名称，我帮您查询实时数据。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "介绍白茶", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "介绍白茶", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "介绍白茶", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "Introduce white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "介绍白茶 | white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "白茶是什么", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["66", "67", "77", "78", "57"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
{"event": "turn", "session_id": "8cae132ff87d4760967d39fc0b0a3dcd", "sequence": 2, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:29:06.205857+00:00", "message": "白茶选购要点", "resolved_question": "白茶选购要点有哪些？", "context_turns": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 16.581, "model_calls": 5, "input_tokens": 8221, "output_tokens": 1164, "response": {"answer": "**白茶选购要点**\n\n根据本次工具检索到的证据，白茶选购可参考以下几点：\n\n1. **先确认加工类型**：白茶按 ISO 20715:2023 的定义，是采摘的茶芽经萎凋和干燥加工而成的茶，指山茶属茶树的茶类型及加工方式，不是白色花朵或草本植物泡制的饮品。选购时先确认产品属于这一加工类型。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n\n2. **区分品种与茶类**：茶树品种（cultivar）与白茶这一加工产品类型是两个概念。同一品种用不同加工方法可制成不同茶类，品种本身不决定成品茶类型或香气，加工方式同样关键。（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）\n\n3. **多维度看产品描述**：一款茶产品可从加工类型、品种、产地、制作风格、等级、添加配料、产品形态等多方面描述，不宜只用一个茶类标签概括。选购时可结合这些属性判断。（来源：Typology of Processed Tea）\n\n4. **注意分类体系差异**：茶分类可因国家、传统和分类目的不同而有差异，本地市场术语可能按氧化程度、加工方法、外观或习惯名称来归类。判断一款茶是什么类型时，应把叶片加工类别与产地、品种、等级、调味、零售形态区分开。（来源：Typology of Processed Tea）\n\n5. **冲泡不能套用统一公式**：茶类只是冲泡的起点，并不规定统一的时间或温度。叶片等级、颗粒大小、品种、水质、用量和期望浓度都会影响萃取，建议按生产者说明并依口味调整。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n\n**关于风味、用途、价格、库存等**：本次工具未提供白茶风味、功效用途、价格或库存数据，这些属性无法验证，暂不能为您介绍。如果您想了解具体某款白茶商品的价格或库存，可以告诉我商品名称，我帮您查询实时数据。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "model", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "白茶选购要点", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "model"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "白茶选购要点有哪些?", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "白茶选购要点有哪些?", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "What are the key points for selecting white tea?", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "白茶选购要点有哪些? | white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "挑选白茶时需要注意哪些要点?", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["66", "74", "77", "78", "75"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
